.card.border-0.bg-light
  .card-body
    %h2.h5 Goal of this page
    %p.mb-3
      Anyone can propose apply-ready edits to this Ability—including milestone level prose—so skill ladders stay fresh. People with MAAP update permission apply or reject submitted proposals.

    %h2.h5 How proposals move
    %ol.mb-0
      %li Draft in-product or via markdown download / re-upload.
      %li Submit when ready. Submitted proposals also appear in the MAAP Cleanup Inbox.
      %li An editor applies (with a version bump) or rejects the whole proposal.
